msgstr "此操作需先进行性能测试，不能直接应用。请使用配套工具完成两个阶段。"

msgid "Minimum confidence for conservative mode. 0.65 = 65%."
msgstr "保守模式的最低置信度。0.65 即 65%。"

msgid "Minimum confidence for assisted mode. 0.75 = 75%."
msgstr "辅助模式的最低置信度。0.75 即 75%。"

msgid ""
"Pause automatic Rill decisions when performance changes by more than this "
"value. 0.20 = 20%."
msgstr "性能变化超过此值时暂停 Rill 自动决策。0.20 即 20%。"

msgid "Performance changed too much"
msgstr "性能变化过大"

#: package/luci-app-performance-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/performance-manager/rill.js:51
msgid "Performance changed too much. Rill automation paused."
msgstr "性能变化过大，Rill 自动决策已暂停。"

#: package/luci-app-performance-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/performance-manager/optimize.js:20
msgid "Performance changed too much. Automatic Rill decisions paused."
msgstr "性能变化过大，Rill 自动决策已暂停。"

#: package/luci-app-performance-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/performance-manager/capabilities.js:20
msgid "Review capabilities detected on this device."
msgstr "查看此设备检测到的能力。"

msgid "Unknown reason"
msgstr "未知原因"

msgid ""
"Run assisted automation only while traffic is below this limit. The default "
"is about 1 MiB/s."
msgstr "流量低于此值时才运行辅助自动化。默认约为 1 MiB/s。"

#: package/luci-app-performance-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/performance-manager/settings.js:11
msgid ""
"Manual mode leaves each action to you. Conservative mode applies safe "
"actions automatically. Assisted mode also needs a separate switch, a time "
"window and low traffic."
msgstr "手动模式由你决定是否应用。保守模式会自动应用安全操作。辅助模式还需单独开启，并满足维护时段和低流量条件。"

msgid "Ready for decisions"
msgstr "可参与决策"
